WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:08.290
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:14.790
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.630
It's my day!

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:27.200
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:34.610
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:41.990
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:49.390
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:55.170
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:02.310
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:09.810
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:15.950
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:19.020
I just want to walk

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:22.560
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.530
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:35.440
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:41.880
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.150
It's my day!

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.480
- Good morning.
- Good morning.

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.060
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:05.440
<i>Hurry up and
take off your clothes, too.</i>

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:06.850
<i>What?!</i>

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:09.500
<i>You'll never warm up if you keep
that wet sweater on.</i>

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:11.870
<i>I-I'm fine...</i>

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:14.560
<i>This is no time to be embarrassed.</i>

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:17.680
<i>Look at your feet.
They're nearly frostbitten.</i>

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:28.760
<i>Don't stare, okay?</i>

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:33.030
<i>Take off your bottoms, too.</i>

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:36.030
<i>What?! Absolutely not!</i>

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:40.200
<i>It's up to you. You're the one
who's going to freeze.</i>

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:44.700
<i>Domyoji...
don't get any ideas, okay?</i>

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:52.040
<i>Is this really the time for that?!</i>

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.950
<i>I-I'm sorry, it just slipped out...</i>

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:59.250
<i>Never mind. Come sit by the fire.</i>

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:11.230
<i>Let's just go to sleep.</i>

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:18.370
<i>Your body's so cold. You're like ice.</i>

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:21.570
<i>So warm...</i>

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:25.540
<i>Of course... You're 
soaking up my body heat.</i>

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:31.280
<i>I never knew that someone's body heat
could feel so good.</i>

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:36.320
<i>Domyoji... You're a 
nice guy, aren't you?</i>

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:39.560
<i>Being called a "nice guy"
doesn't even make me happy.</i>

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.660
<i>I'd rather you called me
a gentleman.</i>

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:48.200
<i>You're far from a gentleman, but
you're so nice and warm.</i>

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:57.610
<i>This girl... she pisses me off...</i>

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:09.020
Good morning.

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:10.320
Good morning.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:14.970
<i>How should I act</i>

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:17.290
<i>when I see him again?</i>

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:24.670
<i>Yikes!</i>

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:26.100
<i>Yikes!</i>

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.840
Tsukasa, say hello to your lady love.

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:32.080
W-what are you talking about?!

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.010
There you go...

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:41.950
Y-yo...

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:45.320
G-good morning.

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:51.390
<i>Why in the worid is he blushing?!</i>

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:59.080
What are you so embarrassed about?

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:01.460
Didn't you two warm each other
with your bare bodies?

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:05.870
Stop! I don't even want to think about it!
Especially because of <i>him!</i>

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.680
It's the biggest mistake
of my life!

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:10.550
How can you say that?!
After I saved you...

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:14.450
I nearly went blind looking at
your bony butt.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.750
What's that?!

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.010
What?!

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:19.590
All right! Mix it up!

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:28.230
"Do You Want a Friend?"

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:40.710
<i>Humph! So much for trying
to forget everything...</i>

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.990
Makino, I'm <i>so</i> glad to see
you're feeling better.

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:58.690
We really regret what happened
in Canada.

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:04.360
Not! Like we'd actually say that!

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:15.510
Thanks to us, you got up close and
personal with Domyoji...

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:18.080
You should be thanking us.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:21.280
How can you say that?!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:24.260
I almost died because of you!

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:27.420
Yeah! You should have died there.

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:32.590
How rotten can you be?

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:39.500
Just looking at you makes me sick!
Get out of my face!

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:42.900
Oh, scary!

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:55.080
What a klutz!

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.260
Oh, my!

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:08.070
- What are you doing?!
- That was dangerous!

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:13.130
I'm sorry! They just slipped out.

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:19.160
Watch what you're doing, freshman!

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:19.970
Moron!

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:23.440
Moron!

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:50.670
Here.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.040
Thanks.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:08.320
<i>He's so geeky...
I haven't seen him around.</i>

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:12.990
You're Tsukushi Makino, right?

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.090
Eitoku Academy's Joan of Arc!

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:20.630
Huh? Joan of Arc?

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:26.750
<i>Joan of Arc... She led the French army
to victory in some war...</i>

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:30.570
You're my Goddess of Victory.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:32.240
What?

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.120
What was that? Weirdo...

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:50.620
Really? You went through a lot
in Canada, didn't you?

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:53.790
I was able to pay off my dad's debts,

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:56.900
but I'd hate to owe Domyoji forever.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:01.670
Just seaweed and rice again...

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:06.530
<i>But, considering my family's finances,</i>

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:10.240
<i>I should be thankful
that I can have lunch, at all.</i>

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:11.480
What?

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.980
I'll give you some of my egg, too.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.860
But can I have some
of your seaweed and rice?

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:22.360
It's my favorite.

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:25.930
<i>Makiko...</i>

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:28.330
Of course!

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:33.230
<i>It's nice to have friends...</i>

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:35.290
Bye-bye!

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:36.200
See you later!

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:51.450
Hello!

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:56.320
Ouch!

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.260
Are you all right?

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:01.060
Owee...

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:02.660
You!

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:07.830
I'm Junpei Oribe. 
Nice to meet you.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.860
<i>What's with this guy?
He's strange...</i>

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:12.240
I'm so beat...

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:14.340
Oh, no!

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:23.010
Sojiro, what happened to that girl?

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:25.080
You know, the one you picked up
at the club.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:27.650
Oh... I'm seeing her later tonight.

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:31.080
Aren't you the go-getter!
How many have you got lined up?

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:32.260
Maybe 12 or 13...

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:34.460
Wow! What stamina!

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:42.400
What are <i>you</i> hiding for?!

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:44.830
Why are <i>you</i>?

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:49.610
Nothing good comes of being
with those guys!

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:55.750
Oh, yeah... They really gave you
a hard time, didn't they?

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:07.490
Tsukasa... What are you
daydreaming about?

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:12.760
He's probably dreaming
about that night with Makino.

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:19.260
Shut up!
Do you want a knuckle sandwich?

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:24.140
Why would I want to think
about that dog?

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.040
She's flat-chested...

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:31.680
...flat-assed...

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:37.570
I saved her life, and she spits at me.

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:39.390
And talk about an attitude!

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:43.090
In other words...

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:44.580
...no sex appeal!

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:55.970
You idiots!

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:58.100
Boy, your moms...

00:11:58.540 --> 00:11:59.460
What's that?

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:01.430
...must be ugly!

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:03.080
It's coming from over there.

00:12:17.490 --> 00:12:18.760
<i>I don't believe it!</i>

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:23.550
<i>There's someone else on campus,
besides me,</i>

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:25.870
<i>who dares to call the F4 idiots!</i>

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:57.630
Listen. Do you realize
what you've done?

00:12:58.530 --> 00:13:02.400
How can you call them idiots?
Do you want everyone against you?

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:05.070
But, doesn't it make you mad?

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:10.800
They called you a flat-chested,
flat-assed dog

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:13.310
who spits and has a bad attitude...

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.270
Don't repeat everything!
It burns me up!

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:17.600
Anyway...

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:21.450
I'm glad you stood up for me,
but you'd better keep clear of them.

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:25.120
I see. I learned something.

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:28.230
<i>Does he get it?!</i>

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:31.220
I guess I should just hang on
for two more years.

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:33.000
That's right. Just two more years.

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:38.000
<i>Huh? That sounds familiar...</i>

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:42.640
<i>Oh, you bought that Buittan bag?</i>

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:45.610
<i>Uh-hm... But it cost less
than 100,000 yen.</i>

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:49.000
<i>I've been trying to get my dad
to buy me a Shanel watch.</i>

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:50.480
<i>I envy you...</i>

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:53.980
<i>Just two more years...</i>

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:56.350
<i>Just hang on for two more years.</i>

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:04.430
<i>I want my school life here
to be peaceful and quiet.</i>

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.900
<i>That's all I ask for.</i>

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:19.240
<i>To think that there's someone else
who thinks like me!</i>

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:21.440
<i>I can't believe it.</i>

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:28.350
What are you doing?!

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:31.550
I put two ants on this paper airplane.

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:34.790
This is you... and this is me.

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.390
I wish we could fly away.

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:40.120
Like this.

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:03.220
<i>I wish I could fly away...</i>

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:08.960
<i>I used to feel that way all the time
back then.</i>

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:18.230
You're working until closing again?

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:24.240
My dad hasn't found a job yet.
And I'm still in debt to Domyoji.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:26.070
I've got to work hard!

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:28.810
You've been through a lot, huh?

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.280
Yuki...

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.320
Those three harpies...

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:41.950
What's with Eitoku Academy, anyway?

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:45.530
That's what I'd like to know!

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:51.380
But the F4 are much nicer
than you made them out to be.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:54.830
- Especially Rui and Domyo...
- Don't talk about Domyoji!

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:57.570
Tsukushi...

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:02.240
<i>I know... I know, but...</i>

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:05.940
Good night!

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:14.990
<i>Even if I work longer hours,
we only cover our living expenses.</i>

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:19.360
<i>I won't be able to repay Domyoji
for a long time to come.</i>

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:23.130
<i>I guess I have to find another job.</i>

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:26.900
Watch it!

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:29.600
I'm sorry!

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:35.120
You've got something interesting,
don't you?

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:35.640
Huh?

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:39.580
Junpei Oribe?!

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:44.350
Just what are you doing here?

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:48.220
F-R-I-E-N-D

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:50.820
Friend?

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:54.390
Don't you want one?

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:58.000
What? Who are you talking about?

00:16:58.600 --> 00:16:59.230
Me.

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:04.300
This weird kid? My friend?

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:09.170
I'm all by myself at Eitoku.

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:14.550
If you'd be my friend,
I'd feel so much better.

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:23.290
I'll pilot our paper airplane,
so won't you be the navigator?

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:28.920
<i>I should just hang on
for two more years.</i>

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:31.360
<i>I wish we could fly away.</i>

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:35.730
Zoooom!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:42.000
<i>He's a little strange,
but he might not be so bad.</i>

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.110
If you'll be my friend,
I'll tell you something.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:50.980
My deepest secret.

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:53.450
Secret?

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:05.460
<i>A secret?
But why'd he bring me here?</i>

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:09.300
<i>I wonder what he's up to.</i>

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:13.940
<i>The more I think about it,
the more strange he seems...</i>

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:17.970
<i>Kind of harmless in a goofy way...</i>

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:28.620
<i>And he wants to be friends with me?</i>

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:31.620
<i>Don't you want one?</i>

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:36.220
Making friends with someone like me,
who's hated by everybody...

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:38.730
is like flying into a flame.

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:44.830
What?! Is it this late?

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:49.400
What is he doing?! 
It's much too late.

00:18:50.470 --> 00:18:51.910
I'm going home.

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.240
Oh, there you are.

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.150
Come this way.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:01.480
Huh?

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:06.090
Here you go.

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:13.830
What are you doing?! Stop it!

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:28.410
What in the world is going on?

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:35.950
Go on in.

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:37.880
Huh?

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:47.930
Look this way.
Give me a wilder look.

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:49.660
Try something provocative.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:53.240
That's it. Give me more. A little more...

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:54.910
I like that expression.

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:56.470
That's great!

00:20:04.270 --> 00:20:05.510
No way!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:08.610
<i>Is that Junpei Oribe?</i>

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:11.490
<i>What's with him?</i>

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:14.230
<i>At school, he acts so geeky.</i>

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:16.790
<i>To think he was modeling on the side...</i>

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:20.290
Okay, let's try another outfit.

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:22.330
Jun, try one more outfit.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.740
All right...

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:28.300
Makino... How cute!

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:31.730
What do you mean "cute"?!

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:37.610
I see what your secret is, but
why do I have to dress like this, too?

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:41.920
Don't get so angry.
Isn't it fun to play dress-up?

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:43.550
Listen!

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:46.750
Jun... Hurry and get dressed.

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:48.850
Okay!

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:50.830
Let's go, Makino.

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:55.990
Th-this is not funny!
I can't possibly model!

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:02.730
There's nothing to worry about.
Just relax and smile.

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:05.730
These photos won't appear
in any magazine.

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.540
There's no reason to get uptight.

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:12.390
You say that,
but I'm just a regular girl.

00:21:12.390 --> 00:21:14.290
I can't just smile into a camera!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.140
Here we go...

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:19.410
Look this way, girlfriend.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.550
Come on, relax... relax.

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:27.620
Jun, put your arm around her shoulder.

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:30.160
That's the way...

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:32.460
Hey! Don't touch me!

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:34.630
Smile! Smile!

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:39.570
Pull her in. Tighter...

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:41.570
Get your arms around her!

00:22:05.460 --> 00:22:11.530
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:19.410
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.170 --> 00:22:29.280
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.520 --> 00:22:37.320
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.320 --> 00:22:45.100
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:53.240
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:53.240
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.240 --> 00:23:01.610
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.240 --> 00:23:01.610
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:11.390
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.390 --> 00:23:19.160
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.430 --> 00:23:27.340
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.430 --> 00:23:27.340
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:35.750
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:35.750
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:47.960 --> 00:23:50.060
It's uncomfortable to have love
forced on you.

00:23:50.330 --> 00:23:53.100
Cornered and unable to escape...

00:23:53.230 --> 00:23:55.200
It all started
with an insignificant event.

00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:59.940
Then suppressed emotions
suddenly burst out.

00:24:00.640 --> 00:24:04.510
Hana Yori Dango:
"Shock! Another Red Card!"

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:08.510
The bright red card felt like his goodbye.
